  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libwrc

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libwrc/archive/refs/tags/20260705.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libwrc-20260705-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libwrc-20260705-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libwrc-20260705-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwrc-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwrc1-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwrc-devel-20260705-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libwrc-20260705-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libwrc)
  /usr/bin/wrcinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libwrc.README
